  "question": {
    "text": "The mean free path and the average speed of oxygen molecules at 300 K and 1 atm are $3 \\times 10^{-7} \\mathrm{~m}$ and $600 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}$ respectively. Find the frequency of its collisions.",
    "image": null
  },
